{"name": "Chapel 3-D: The Ascent", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd90\ufe0f Unlimited power at your fingertips! Start off as a feeble weakling of a human being and transform into a terrifying fire-breathing monster by separating your heart from your body. Beware, however, as gaining such power is a cardinal sin and you will have to pay for your transgressions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd90\ufe0f Set out on a daring, inter-dimensional escape and travel between various different worlds to flee the wrath of your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd90\ufe0f Use your newfound powers to your advantage; throw your heart around and teleport to it at will. Run, jump and traverse the levels nimble as a cat and feel good doing it thanks to the fluid movement system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904680/extras/d38c5d5875e589ac26f4f6ff2176b85e.webp?t=1772451383\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"216\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904680/extras/91d2aabf777df8ac42fe4c86162278ab.poster.avif?t=1772451383\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904680/extras/91d2aabf777df8ac42fe4c86162278ab.webm?t=1772451383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904680/extras/91d2aabf777df8ac42fe4c86162278ab.mp4?t=1772451383\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904680/extras/d38c5d5875e589ac26f4f6ff2176b85e.webp?t=1772451383\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 Get on the offensive and use a variety of deadly spells at your disposal in fast-paced, break-neck pace combat. Being a forsaken beast of a man has some perks, after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 Try not to get distracted as you marvel at the carefully-crafted beautiful locations, all in nostalgic retro-inspired aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 Finally experience the story behind the events of Cathedral 3-D and become one with the monster on your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 Run, jump, fight, dive,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 SURVIVE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904680/extras/d38c5d5875e589ac26f4f6ff2176b85e.webp?t=1772451383\" width=\"616\"/></span>\\</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"216\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904680/extras/29def6cbca370bac0c71827bf07b63a5.poster.avif?t=1772451383\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904680/extras/29def6cbca370bac0c71827bf07b63a5.webm?t=1772451383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904680/extras/29def6cbca370bac0c71827bf07b63a5.mp4?t=1772451383\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904680/extras/d38c5d5875e589ac26f4f6ff2176b85e.webp?t=1772451383\" width=\"616\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "\ud83d\udd25 Chapel 3-D: The Ascent is a break-neck, violent boomer shooter inspired by classics of the genre. Experience the story behind the events of Cathedral 3-D and make your enemies regret ever crossing your path. Become a beast and let loose. \ud83d\udd25", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904680/header.jpg?t=1772451383", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["FPS", "Action", "Difficult", "3D", "First-Person", "Horror"], "developers": "Unfinished Games", "publishers": "Unfinished Games", "release_date": "Feb 19, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "1904680", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "19 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/hJ7p6sHIdLE", "first_seen": 1771455600.0, "review_rank": 1164}